<title>SWEDEN: Bofors says wins Thai air force order.</title>
<headline>Bofors says wins Thai air force order.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish arms producer Bofors, part of the Celsius group, said on Friday it had won an order to provide its RBS 70 MkII air base defence system to the Royal Thai Air Force.  </p>
<p>The RBS 70 is a man-portable, laser-guided surface-to-air missile system. The MkII missile is the third generation of missiles for the system, Bofors said in a statement.</p>
<p>The system will be operation in Thailand in 1997, Bofors said. No financial details were disclosed of the order.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom, +46-8-700 1006</p>
